Explanation of the change:

1. We pull `id: customId` out of `props` so it isn’t spread inadvertently onto the wrong element.
2. We import `useFallbackId` (though in this pattern we inline the fallback logic—it could also be `const id = useFallbackId(customId)`).
3. We generate an ID only when the user has not provided one, avoiding the duplicate-ID conflict with the Footer’s own generated IDs.
